# Ledgers/catalogs — local paths, local state, never in the repo
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Regenerable outputs (root-anchored: docs/figures/ holds curated,
# committed assets and must NOT be caught by this). The 8 snr_curve_<id>.json
# below are NOT regenerable output -- they encode real measurement results
# against external raw DAS data that isn't in the repo, and sustain the
# whole provenance chain (docs/observaciones.md, docs/array_geometry_table.md).
# `/figures/*` (not `/figures/`) so the negations below are actually
# reachable -- git never descends into an excluded directory, so
# `/figures/` + `!/figures/snr_curve_*.json` silently matched nothing.
# Exact filenames, not a `snr_curve_*.json` glob: a glob also caught
# snr_curve_fossa_smoketest.json (a pilot/smoke-test artifact, n=2/step,
# not part of the frozen 8-array series) -- enumerate the 8 explicitly so
# a future stray snr_curve_*.json can never slip in silently.
/figures/*
!/figures/snr_curve_arcata.json
!/figures/snr_curve_foresee.json
!/figures/snr_curve_fossa.json
!/figures/snr_curve_monterey_bay.json
!/figures/snr_curve_ridgecrest_north.json
!/figures/snr_curve_stanford1_campus.json
!/figures/snr_curve_stanford2_sandhill.json
!/figures/snr_curve_valencia_submarine.json
/scoreboard.md
*.jsonl
!validacion_real/*.jsonl

# Generated preprint artifacts (regenerable from docs/writeup.md +
# figures/ via pandoc/Chrome headless; not source, not committed)
docs/writeup_v1.1.0_preprint.html
docs/writeup_v1.1.0_preprint.pdf

